# Android debug signing key. builder/build.sh restores it into ~/.android when present,
# so debug builds keep one signature across machines; it is guarded by a file check and
# simply does nothing without it. Not committed: a keystore in a public repository trips
# every secret scanner, and the only thing lost is a stable DEBUG signature.
src/android-app/debug.keystore
